1. Naive Prompt
Create a recipe for a Basque Cheesecake.

2. Persona Prompt
Act as an award-winning pastry chef with expertise in artisan bakeries and commercial baking.

Create a Basque Cheesecake recipe suitable for a home bakery business.
Include:
• Ingredients in grams
• Equipment
• Baking Temperature
• Baking Time
• Cooling
• Storage
• Shelf Life

3. Enhanced Persona Prompt
You are the Head Pastry Chef of a premium artisan bakery.
Develop a Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) for producing Basque Cheesecake for Immanuel's Bakehouse.
The SOP should include:
• Batch Size
• Ingredients
• Mixing Procedure
• Critical Control Points
• Baking Parameters
• Cooling Procedure
• Packaging
• Labelling
• Shelf Life
• Quality Inspection Checklist
• Customer Acceptance Criteria
Present the output as an ISO-style production document.

4. Bonus Prompt (Business)
Act as a bakery business consultant.
Prepare a launch strategy for Immanuel's Bakehouse for the next 30 days.
Include:
• Marketing
• Instagram Content
• WhatsApp Catalogue
• Production Schedule
• Inventory Planning
• Cost Control
• Daily Sales Target
• Customer Acquisition Strategy
Present the output as a weekly action plan.
